    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 4,
        "text": "I used to think if God had wanted all women to be happy he would have made aii men like me... until two weeks ago. How did a smart, good lookin' brother end up like this? Truth is... I guess I'm here ‘cause of some shit I've been doing fora long, long time..."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 761,
        "text": "Believe it or not, I stopped tryin’ to. be The Man and became a man. Smitty's insurance paid for most of the water damage and we reopened the club... It's packed every night. Yeah... Smitty made uS partners."
      }
